            "review_title": "Review at Lien Huong Vegetarian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "SaigonWalks by SciviTravel\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnam macrobiotic cuisine\nJan 2018 • Friends\n[Important] This restaurant has been relocated to 10D Tran Nhat Duat, District 1. Foods are prepared in accordance to Vietnamese macrobiotic concepts, which means each dish has a purpose to improve to cure something. Good taste, clean, fair service and reasonable price.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 23, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
