            "review_title": "Review at Lien Huong Vegetarian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nú Nâu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam102 contributions\n0\nAmazing vegeterian food!\nApr 2018 • Couples\nLove this place as I've usually come here for my lunch. My favorite food is deep fried mushroom wrapped with rice paper, fresh vegetables and noodles. I have no idea what sauce it is, but I love it. One more plus point is the reasonable price even though they're located in D1.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 3, 2018",
