            "review_text": "Nicole C\n30 contributions\n0\nSmall, Hidden Restaurant with Amazing Food\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nIt's hidden down a small alleyway but well worth visiting. The best Vietnamese vegetarian food that I've tried. Some unusual vegan options along with some usuals. I regularly get the braised tofu and mushroom in Clay pot. The whole grain rice that they offer is delicious and I haven't been able to find it anywhere else.\nWritten February 11, 2017",
